flowchart TB
    GitHub[GitHub Actions: validate and smoke test] -->|OIDC: repository main branch only| DeliveryRole[IAM delivery role]
    DeliveryRole -->|SHA tags| ECR[ECR immutable backend/frontend images]
    DeliveryRole -->|SHA bundle and checksum| S3[Private versioned S3 releases]
    DeliveryRole -->|Custom deploy document| SSM[SSM Run Command]
    subgraph VPC[Dedicated VPC]
        subgraph Public[Public subnet]
            subgraph EC2[EC2: IMDSv2 and instance role]
                Launcher[Locked release launcher with health gates and rollback]
                Nginx[Non-root Nginx / React]
                Backend[Non-root Spring Boot]
                Prometheus[Prometheus]
                Grafana[Grafana]
                Exporters[Node and Blackbox exporters]
                Collector[Host Docker textfile collector]
                Alerts[Alertmanager]
            end
        end
        subgraph Private[Two isolated database subnets / two AZs]
            RDS[Private RDS MySQL: encryption and backups]
        end
    end
    Reviewer[Reviewer CIDR] -->|HTTP 80| Nginx
    Nginx -->|API and readiness| Backend
    Backend -->|3306 TLS: EC2 SG only| RDS
    SSM --> Launcher
    Launcher --> ECR
    Launcher --> S3
    Launcher --> Secrets[Secrets Manager: RDS and application]
    Launcher --> Nginx
    Launcher --> Backend
    Prometheus -->|Internal management 8081| Backend
    Prometheus --> Exporters
    Collector -->|Restart and uptime textfile| Exporters
    Grafana --> Prometheus
    Prometheus --> Alerts
    Alerts -.->|Optional secret-file webhook| Slack[Operations Slack]
    Operator[Authorized operator] -->|SSM port forwarding| Grafana
